  "text": "CG\nЦГ\nEN\nPress room\nAll news\nOrganization\nDocument library\nAccessibility\nHomepage\nMinistry of Foreign Affairs\nDiplomatic missions\nEmbassies and consulates of Montenegro and visa regimes for foreign citizens\nPanama\nPanama*\nEmbassies and consulates of Montenegro and visa regimes for foreign citizens\nPanama\nVisa regime\nNationals of Panama may enter, pass through the territory of and stay in Montenegro up to 90 days, with a valid travel document, without a visa.\nDiplomatic relations\nThe Republic of Panama recognized Montenegro on 25 August 2006. Diplomatic relations between Montenegro and the Republic of Panama were established on 9 May 2008.\nThe Panama Embassy in Athens covers Montenegro on a non-resident basis, while Montenegro has appointed Dragan Buric as honorary consul to Panama City.\nHomepage\nPress room\nAll news\nOrganization\nDocument library\nAsk the Government\nPR contacts\nFacebook\nX\nInstagram\nYouTube\nFlickr\nePayment\neHealth\neGovernment\nеTax\neEnrollment\nCentral Register of Business Entities\nAccessibility\nSite map\nEnglish\n©Copyright 2026. Government of MontenegroOpšti uslovi korišćenjaThis site is protected by reCAPTCHA and applies Googleprivacy policyandterms of serice.",
